# CQ2 — What metrics does a company report, and for what time period?

PREFIX fin: <https://froilan-sia.github.io/finance-ontology-rag/ontology#>

SELECT ?metricLabel ?value ?periodLabel
WHERE {
    ?metric a fin:Metric ;
            fin:metricForCompany ?company ;
            fin:hasValue ?value ;
            fin:forTimePeriod ?period .
    ?company fin:hasName ?metricLabel .
    ?period fin:hasPeriodLabel ?periodLabel .
}
ORDER BY ?periodLabel
